  "privacy": {
    "title": "Privacy Policy",
    "html": "<p>Trefelle collects information needed to process orders, provide customer support, improve the shopping experience, and operate secure checkout. This may include contact details, shipping details, order information, optional account information, device information, cookies, analytics data, and support communications.</p><p>We use information to fulfill orders, save carts, provide checkout, maintain optional customer accounts, prevent fraud, send transactional messages, improve products and navigation, and comply with legal, tax, accounting, payment, shipping, and platform obligations.</p><p>Our store is hosted by Shopify. We may also use payment processors, shipping carriers, fulfillment partners, suppliers, analytics tools, advertising platforms, and customer support tools as needed to operate the store.</p><p>We use essential cookies for cart, checkout, account login, fraud prevention, and store functionality. If analytics or marketing tools are enabled, they may use cookies or similar technologies.</p><p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or opt out of certain uses of personal information. Contact us through Shopify Inbox for privacy requests.</p>"
  },
  "no-returns": {
    "title": "No Returns and Refund Policy",
    "html": "<p>We do not accept product returns for buyer remorse, changed mind, ordering the wrong item, dislike of color/size/style, no longer needing the item, duplicate orders, or similar reasons.</p><p>We do not offer exchanges at launch. If you want a different item, size, color, or variant, place a new order after reviewing the product details.</p><p>Do not send products to the address on the package, the supplier, a carrier address, or any address found online. Because we are not accepting returns, unauthorized packages may be refused, lost, delayed, destroyed, or ineligible for refund. We do not publish or use a personal home address for returns.</p><p>If an item arrives damaged, defective, incorrect, incomplete, missing, or materially different from the listing, contact us through Shopify Inbox as soon as possible with your order number, checkout email, product name, clear issue description, and photos or video of the product, packaging, shipping label, and issue.</p><p>If approved, we may offer a replacement, refund, partial refund, store credit, discount code, or another reasonable resolution. We may resolve the issue without requiring the item to be returned.</p><p>If we cannot fulfill an order or cannot ship within the stated timeframe, we will notify you and provide options as required, which may include canceling for a refund.</p>"
  },
  "shipping": {
    "title": "Shipping Policy",
    "html": "<p>Orders are processed after payment confirmation, fraud review, and supplier or fulfillment availability checks. Standard processing time is usually 2 to 5 business days. Orders placed on weekends or holidays may begin processing on the next business day.</p><p>Standard estimated delivery time is usually 7 to 20 business days after processing. Delivery times shown on product pages, checkout, messages, emails, advertisements, or order updates are estimates unless expressly stated as guaranteed.</p><p>Trefelle is configured for United States orders first. International shipping may be added later. Some products may be unavailable in certain states, territories, countries, regions, PO boxes, military addresses, remote locations, or restricted destinations due to carrier limits, supplier restrictions, legal restrictions, or product restrictions.</p><p>When tracking is available, tracking information will be sent through Shopify order updates, email, SMS if enabled, or the order status page. Tracking may take several business days to update after a label is created.</p><p>If an order contains multiple items, items may ship separately from different locations. You may receive more than one package, tracking number, or delivery date.</p><p>If we cannot ship within the stated timeframe, we will notify you and provide options as required, which may include consenting to the delay or canceling for a refund.</p>"
  },
  "terms": {
    "title": "Terms of Service",
    "html": "<p>These Terms of Service apply when you access, browse, or purchase from Trefelle. By using the store, placing an order, creating an account, contacting support, or interacting with our services, you agree to these Terms.</p><p>You agree to use the store lawfully and not to misuse, disrupt, copy, scrape, attack, reverse engineer, overload, or interfere with the store, checkout, payment systems, customer accounts, Shopify Inbox, or related services.</p><p>We try to provide accurate product titles, descriptions, prices, images, categories, variants, availability, shipping estimates, and other details. Errors may occur. We may correct errors, update listings, change pricing, cancel orders, refuse orders, limit quantities, or issue refunds when information is inaccurate, incomplete, unavailable, restricted, or suspected of fraud.</p><p>Products must be used only as intended and according to any instructions, warnings, manuals, labels, compatibility notes, age guidance, or manufacturer guidance. We are not responsible for misuse, improper installation, unauthorized modification, unsafe use, or failure to follow instructions.</p><p>Shipping is governed by our Shipping Policy. Returns and refunds are governed by our No Returns and Refund Policy. We do not accept buyer-remorse returns or exchanges at launch. Do not send products back to the sender, supplier, package address, carrier address, or any address found online.</p><p>Damaged, defective, wrong, missing, unshipped, or materially inaccurate orders should be reported through Shopify Inbox so we can review the issue and offer an appropriate resolution where required or approved.</p><p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, exemplary, or punitive damages, including lost profits, lost data, delivery delays, business interruption, product misuse, or third-party service issues.</p>"
  },
  "legal": {
    "title": "Legal Notice",
    "html": "<p>This Legal Notice applies to Trefelle and the Shopify store where this notice is published.</p><p>Trefelle is an online retail storefront operated through Shopify. The final public business name, legal entity name, business mailing address, registered agent address, or other required business disclosure should be configured before accepting real customer orders. Do not use a personal home address as the public store address.</p><p>For customer support, order questions, shipping issues, product questions, refund review, damaged items, wrong items, missing items, or account questions, contact Trefelle through Shopify Inbox using the chat or contact option shown on the store.</p><p>Legal or formal notices should be sent through Shopify Inbox unless and until a separate business mailing address, registered agent, attorney, or formal notice address is published by the store operator.</p><p>This Legal Notice should be read together with the Terms of Service, Privacy Policy, Shipping Policy, No Returns and Refund Policy, Cookie Policy, and Contact and Support Policy.</p>"
  },
  "contact": {
    "title": "Contact Us",
    "html": "<p>For customer support, use Shopify Inbox through the chat or contact option shown on the store.</p><p>For faster help, include your order number, email used at checkout, product name, clear description of the issue, photos or videos for damaged, defective, incorrect, or missing items, and tracking number if available.</p><p>Typical response time is 1 to 2 business days. Response times may be longer during weekends, holidays, launches, supplier delays, shipping events, or high support volume.</p><p>Do not send products to any address. We are starting with a no-return model and do not accept buyer-remorse returns or exchanges.</p>"
